### Instagram API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json
@authToken = your_jwt_token_here

### 1. Connect Instagram Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/instagram/connect
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "accessToken": "instagram_access_token_here",
  "userId": "instagram_user_id_here"
}

### 2. Get Instagram Account Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/instagram/account
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3. Get Instagram Media
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/instagram/media
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Get Instagram Media with Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/instagram/media?limit=10&after=cursor_here
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Get Specific Instagram Media
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/instagram/media/media_id_here
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. Get Instagram Insights
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/instagram/insights
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. Get Instagram Messages
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/instagram/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Send Instagram Message
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/instagram/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "recipientId": "instagram_user_id",
  "message": "Hello! This is an automated message."
}

### 9. Get Instagram Webhooks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/instagram/webhooks
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 10. Disconnect Instagram Account
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/instagram/disconnect
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}